---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Base>
  <section class="band hero" id="top">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Cassidy's Cookies</p>
        <h1>Cookie Decorating Classes</h1>
        <p>Do you want to learn the basics of decorating sugar cookies? If so, then my classes are perfect for you!!</p>
        <p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="#current">Sign up today</a> <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#mailing">Join my mailing list</a></p>
      </div>
      <img class="hero-photo hero-photo-1" src="/images/cassidydec.webp" width="900" height="900" alt="Six decorated holiday sugar cookies on a baking tray" fetchpriority="high" />
      <img class="hero-logo" src="/images/cassidys-cookies-logo.png" width="692" height="350" alt="Cassidy's Cookies logo" />
      <img class="hero-photo hero-photo-2" src="/images/cassidydec.webp" width="900" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="white" id="current">
    <div class="wrap center">
      <h2>My Current Courses</h2>
      <p>I add new classes frequently so check back often to see what's in the oven.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card"><h3>Easy Steps to Follow</h3><p>You will practice basic piping and filling techniques and will walk away with 6 beautifully decorated cookies (3 cookies in the Kid's Class).</p></div>
        <div class="card card-accent"><h3>Learn Many Techniques</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Tips on how to get the right royal icing consistency for both piping and flooding</li>
            <li>Piping techniques</li>
            <li>Flooding techniques</li>
            <li>Wet on wet techniques</li>
            <li>Drying and storing cookies</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card"><h3>No Experience Needed</h3><p>You don't need any previous experience decorating cookies! All supplies will be provided.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="class">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="class-top">
        <img class="class-photo" src="/images/cassidydec.webp" width="900" height="900" alt="Hallmark Movies cookie set: a couch, TV, pajamas, a mug, a sweater and slippers" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <h2>This Month's Class</h2>
          <p class="class-title">Hallmark Movies - Countdown to Christmas</p>
          <p class="price">$55</p>
          <p class="small">*Recommended for ages 10 and up. Use your discretion. You know your children best. If your younger child can pay attention and would do well in class, they are welcome to attend, but everyone in attendance must have a paid seat.</p>
          <p><span class="btn btn-disabled" role="link" aria-disabled="true">Sold out</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="info">
        <div class="info-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5 7 13 7 13s7-8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z"/></svg>
          <p>The Den<br />235 Broadway Ave<br />Yankton, SD</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 7h14v11H5V9zm2 2v2h2v-2H7zm4 0v2h2v-2h-2zm4 0v2h2v-2h-2zM7 15v2h2v-2H7zm4 0v2h2v-2h-2z"/></svg>
          <p>December 12, 2026<br />10:00am - Noon</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.6 12.8a4 4 0 0 1-3.4-3.4 4 4 0 0 1-4-4 1 1 0 0 0-1.2-1A10 10 0 1 0 22 14a1 1 0 0 0-.4-1.2zM8.5 8a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0-3zm-1 7.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 3zm5 3a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 0 3zm4-3a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2z"/></svg>
          <p>6 Cookies to Create</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="details">
        <h3>More Details</h3>
        <p>All sales are FINAL. Due to the nature of the class, I will not be able to refund payment or apply it to a future class. If you find yourself in a position where you will be unable to attend, please feel free to re-sell your seat or gift it to a friend or family member. Please, just let me know who will be taking your seat so that I am able to update my attendee list.</p>
        <p>If you are interested in registering a child/children ages 10 and under, please email me before registering, for further info.</p>
        <p>I reserve the right to cancel this class due to illness/low enrollment. In which case you will be offered a full refund.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="white" id="private">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="private center">
        <h2>Private Cookie Decorating Classes Available</h2>
        <p>Looking for a fun activity for an event? Want a more intimate setting for your group to learn the basics of cookie decorating? Then a private cookie decorating class is for you!</p>
        <p>I come to your home or venue. You provide the work space and seating for your guests and I’ll provide everything we need for the cookie decorating class! Please contact me for more information.</p>
        <div class="two">
          <div>
            <h3>Children's Classes (Ages 6-12)</h3>
            <ul><li>Minimum of 10 kids/max 20</li><li>Each child will decorate a 3 cookie set</li><li>Approximately 1-1.5 hours</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Adult Classes</h3>
            <ul><li>Minimum 10/max 20</li><li>Each person will decorate a 6 cookie set</li><li>Approximately 2 hours</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p><a class="btn" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Contact me for pricing</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="mailing">
    <div class="wrap center">
      <h2>Join My Mailing List</h2>
      <div class="form-card">
        <p class="small">Join my mailing list to be notified of future classes.</p>
        <div class={`elfsight-app-${site.elfsightId}`} data-elfsight-app-lazy></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="https://elfsightcdn.com/platform.js" async></script>
</Base>
